{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund free sanitary products for female pupils & endometriosis support",
        "additional_details": "In many areas, families may not be able to afford period products for their female family members. When this happens, girls may miss out on vital parts of their education and fall behind. We urge the Government to provide schools with appropriate funding to provide these products for free so girls can still attend schools.\r\n \r\nWe urge the Government to support young women and children suffering from endometriosis, a very painful condition, to ensure a good quality of life for them.\r\n",
        "background": "We urge the Government to increase funding for schools to provide free sanitary products for female pupils, so they can continue to attend school and receive an education, and dedicated funding to support pupils suffering from endometriosis, so they have appropriate support.",
